# =============================================================================
# FDS4559_test.cir expectations
# Source: onsemi FDS4559/D Rev.4, July 2022, electrical characteristics pp.2-3
#
# Typ targets validate the nominal model fit.
# Min/Max targets validate guaranteed datasheet bounds.
# For RDS(on), the bench measures VDS/VSD at the exact datasheet current,
# therefore expected voltages below are I * RDS(on).
# =============================================================================
# measurement   mode  tolerance  expected
N1_VTH_TYP      warn_abs      0.25      2.2
N1_VTH_MIN      min   0.02       1.0
N1_VTH_MAX      max   0.02       3.0
N2_R10_TYP      warn_rel      0.08      0.189
N2_R10_MAX      max   0.02       0.2475
N3_R45_TYP      warn_rel      0.08      0.220
N3_R45_MAX      max   0.02       0.300
N4_VSD_TYP      warn_abs      0.08      0.8
N4_VSD_MAX      max   0.02       1.2
P1_VTH_TYP      warn_abs      0.25      1.6
P1_VTH_MIN      min   0.02       1.0
P1_VTH_MAX      max   0.02       3.0
P2_R10_TYP      warn_rel      0.08      0.287
P2_R10_MAX      max   0.02       0.3675
P3_R45_TYP      warn_rel      0.08      0.3255
P3_R45_MAX      max   0.02       0.4185
P4_VSD_TYP      warn_abs      0.08      0.8
P4_VSD_MAX      max   0.02       1.2
